py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"01"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"项目背景"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","英雄决定了一支队伍的火力上限。它要在大弹丸发射机构、两轴云台、整机供电和底盘承载之间同时做取舍，任何一个环节做薄了都会在对抗中暴露。",{"children":"英雄决定了一支队伍的火力上限。它要在大弹丸发射机构、两轴云台、整机供电和底盘承载之间同时做取舍，任何一个环节做薄了都会在对抗中暴露。"}],["$","p","我们把它作为整机思路的第一个验证平台：底盘、云台、发射、供电分开设计，再用统一的 CAN 拓扑和一套分层代码把它们接起来。",{"children":"我们把它作为整机思路的第一个验证平台：底盘、云台、发射、供电分开设计，再用统一的 CAN 拓扑和一套分层代码把它们接起来。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","我们遇到的问题",{"id":"section-2","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"02"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"我们遇到的问题"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","大弹丸发射瞬间的冲击会通过云台传到整机，连续发射后云台出现明显抖动，弹道一致性下降。",{"children":"大弹丸发射瞬间的冲击会通过云台传到整机，连续发射后云台出现明显抖动，弹道一致性下降。"}],["$","p","加上发射机构和配重之后，底盘起步打滑、急停过冲，原来的加速度曲线不再适用。",{"children":"加上发射机构和配重之后，底盘起步打滑、急停过冲，原来的加速度曲线不再适用。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","解决方案",{"id":"section-3","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"03"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"解决方案"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","重做发射机构与云台的连接支撑，在关键受力点增加加强板和减震垫，把冲击路径从云台电机上引开。",{"children":"重做发射机构与云台的连接支撑，在关键受力点增加加强板和减震垫，把冲击路径从云台电机上引开。"}],["$","p","底盘改为四轮全向 + 独立悬挂，重新分配重心；供电上把发射动力与底盘动力拆成两条支路，避免发射时母线电压被拉低。",{"children":"底盘改为四轮全向 + 独立悬挂，重新分配重心；供电上把发射动力与底盘动力拆成两条支路，避免发射时母线电压被拉低。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","硬件",{"id":"section-4","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"04"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"硬件"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","底盘 4× 无刷电机 + 独立悬挂模组，两轴云台，大弹丸拨盘式发射机构，自绘分电板与电源管理板。",{"children":"底盘 4× 无刷电机 + 独立悬挂模组，两轴云台，大弹丸拨盘式发射机构，自绘分电板与电源管理板。"}],["$","p","主控采用 STM32 系列 MCU，电机、IMU、发射机构之间全部走 CAN，遥控接收与上位机通信走串口。",{"children":"主控采用 STM32 系列 MCU，电机、IMU、发射机构之间全部走 CAN，遥控接收与上位机通信走串口。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","软件",{"id":"section-5","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"05"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"软件"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","STM32 + FreeRTOS 多任务结构：遥控解算、CAN 收发、电机闭环、发射状态机各自独立任务，按周期调度。",{"children":"STM32 + FreeRTOS 多任务结构：遥控解算、CAN 收发、电机闭环、发射状态机各自独立任务，按周期调度。"}],["$","p","代码按 bsp → device → module → app 分层，硬件相关代码只在底层出现，上层模块换板子不用改。",{"children":"代码按 bsp → device → module → app 分层，硬件相关代码只在底层出现，上层模块换板子不用改。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","控制",{"id":"section-6","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"06"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"控制"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","云台用位置环 + 速度环串级 PID，并叠加前馈补偿，缓解大惯量负载下的滞后。",{"children":"云台用位置环 + 速度环串级 PID，并叠加前馈补偿，缓解大惯量负载下的滞后。"}],["$","p","底盘用速度矢量解算四轮转速，限制加速度与角加速度上限；拨盘按固定角度步进，配合热量与冷却状态做发射节奏管理。",{"children":"底盘用速度矢量解算四轮转速，限制加速度与角加速度上限；拨盘按固定角度步进，配合热量与冷却状态做发射节奏管理。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","调试过程",{"id":"section-7","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"07"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"调试过程"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","用 CAN 抓包看总线负载与丢包，确认多电机高频率下发时的时序安全。",{"children":"用 CAN 抓包看总线负载与丢包，确认多电机高频率下发时的时序安全。"}],["$","p","示波器看母线电流与电机相电流，定位发射瞬间的电压跌落；上位机同时拉云台阶跃响应曲线，反复整定 PID 与摩擦补偿。",{"children":"示波器看母线电流与电机相电流，定位发射瞬间的电压跌落；上位机同时拉云台阶跃响应曲线，反复整定 PID 与摩擦补偿。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","最终效果",{"id":"section-8","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"08"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"最终效果"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","连续发射时云台抖动明显收敛，弹道一致性提升；底盘急停过冲减小，可以稳定跑完整场对抗而不需要中途干预。",{"children":"连续发射时云台抖动明显收敛，弹道一致性提升；底盘急停过冲减小，可以稳定跑完整场对抗而不需要中途干预。"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section","比赛表现",{"id":"section-9","className":"scroll-mt-28 py-10 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$","$L7",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"09"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl","children":"比赛表现"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-400 lg:pl-10","children":[["$","p","本赛季随整车一起持续迭代，主要承担火力压制与吸引防守的角色。每一次弹道和云台参数的调整，都会在下一场训练里被验证。",{"children":"本赛季随整车一起持续迭代，主要承担火力压制与吸引防守的角色。每一次弹道和云台参数的调整，都会在下一场训练里被验证。"}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"border-t border-white/10 py-16","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl lg:max-w-none","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/projects/dart","className":"group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-7 transition hover:border-white/25 hover:bg-white/[0.045]","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500","children":[["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 16 16","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.5","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M13.5 8h-11M7 3.5 2.5 8 7 12.5"}]}],"上一个"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-6 font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"飞镖系统"}]]}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/projects/infantry","cla